  "writer": "LightBurn Pro 2.1.01 in hidden Anode session 3",
  "recorded_at": "2026-10-13",
  "method": [
    "Prepare original feature coupon from native start-after probe; place Shape elements before Notes.",
    "Open coupon input in LightBurn; import the exact real DXF through Import a file.",
    "Group multiple imported shapes, position the source at X=150 and Y=100 in the numeric controls, duplicate with Ctrl+D, move the duplicate to the specified X.",
    "Select all canvas objects before native Save Project and Export.",
    "Save each project as .lbrn2 and export AutoCAD Legacy DXF and SVG with Export Arcs selected.",
    "For lb-01 to lb-05, reopen the saved project and export an extra legacy DXF with Convert Arcs to Lines selected; restore Export Arcs afterwards."
  ],
